Id: apa008w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_apache
Fix: Set ProxyRequests Off (it defaults Off); confine any forward proxy with Proxy blocks.
References: Apache Module mod_proxy
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6, CM-7; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

ProxyRequests is On: the server forwards requests for any client
its Proxy blocks allow, and with none confining them it is an open
forward proxy, relaying attacks and spam under this host's name.
Turn it Off unless this host is a forward proxy on purpose.
